Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.85,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}First, how does the game prepare losses?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.88,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}先看游戏怎样准备损失。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.85,0:00:06.02,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Supply, siege, and raiding each have a budget.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.88,0:00:07.11,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}供给、围城和劫掠各有自己的预算；围城
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.02,0:00:08.94,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}Siege and raiding are converted separately
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.11,0:00:11.34,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}与劫掠先各自取成整数，再合起来分配。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.87,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}to integers, then combined for allocation.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.34,0:00:15.63,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}这些预算在第一次兵员写入以前形成，后面
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.87,0:00:15.86,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}These budgets are set before the first soldier write, but
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.63,0:00:19.70,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}的分配却沿着已经变化的人数继续进行。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.86,0:00:19.50,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}later allocations use troop counts that have already
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.05,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}changed.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.70,0:00:23.74,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}把几个显示比例直接相加，再乘同一个总
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.05,0:00:23.49,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}Adding the displayed rates and multiplying by one
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.49,0:00:27.20,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}total misses the intermediate rounding and processing
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.74,0:00:27.55,Chinese,zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}人数，会漏掉中间的取整和先后顺序。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.20,0:00:27.62,English,en-9,0,0,0,,{\q2}order.
